WEBVTT

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.330
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.650
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.820
Today is Rima's birthday!

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.470
We're secretly throwing her a surprise party.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.700
It's so much more exciting when you keep it a secret.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.210
Just wait until you see Amu-chan's homemade cake!

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:21.070
Huh? Someone is staring at Rima.

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:23.630
I have a hunch something is about to happen.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:24.690
Doki!

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.180
Yes! Yes!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.100
Let's go!

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.110
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.900
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:46.600
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:51.140
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.750
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:58.270
Every dream I've ever had!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:03.980
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:10.100
What kind of person will I be today?

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:15.390
What counts is being true to yourself!

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:19.540
Going somewhere?

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.960
Take it to the finish!

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:25.450
You'll always be able to

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:28.390
unlock your heart.

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:31.350
So keep on changing!

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:33.760
It's so exciting!

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:41.890
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.620
Straight ahead!

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:46.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.700
Rima?

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.100
Rima-tan!

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:18.640
Hello!

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.680
Good morning, Rima.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:24.350
Good morning.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:27.910
Who's that?

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.040
No clue.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.990
What's in the box?

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:33.740
Oh, this? It's nothing.

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.920
Look at that, the light's green!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.780
Crosswalk crossin' time!

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:44.720
Episode 69
First Love? Love Attack!

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.380
Bye, Sensei!

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.270
Bye! See you tomorrow!

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.030
Huh? The roof is leaking?

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:57.220
Y-Yeah... The Royal Garden's 
in rough shape right now.

00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:00.980
So you see, we were told we can't go 
in today because they're doing repairs.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.850
Oh, okay...

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.370
And so...

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:05.440
Here!

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:08.770
We were wondering if you could take 
care of this here in the classroom.

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:12.320
W-We've been called to the 
Chairman's Office, so... See ya!

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.830
Give me a break...

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.560
If they're going to lie to me, I wish 
they'd at least do a better job of it.

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:26.480
February 6th

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.910
Way to go, Amu-chi!

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:44.450
I'm embarrassed that it's so lopsided, though...

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.650
Did you make this yourself, Hinamori-san?

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:49.020
I just wake up early sometimes...

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:52.410
And <i>sometimes</i> she ends up buying 
the ingredients the day before.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:56.520
And <i>sometimes</i> she asks her mom 
to teach her how to bake.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.810
She didn't use Su's power at all this time!

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:00.770
Oh, hush!

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:08.610
Do you think Rima will like it?

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.900
It's a cake!

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:16.930
So how's it going? Did Rima-tan realize 
we're throwing a party-dechu?

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.450
No problem, piece of cake!

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:24.270
The party starts at five, so keep her 
away from here until then, okay?

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:27.400
Sure! I just know Rima will be so happy!

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.310
Ready, set... Bala-Balance!

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.930
U-Um...

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.520
What do you want?

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.140
H-Here.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:05.850
Kusukusu.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:08.160
I didn't go anywhere!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.090
I've been in the classroom the whole time!

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:11.760
Can you bring me the stapler?

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:16.020
Say, Rima...

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:17.050
What?

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.350
Do you like cake?

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:19.630
I do.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.640
What about flowers?

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:21.720
Yeah.

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:23.680
What about streamers?

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:24.910
Those, too.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.910
Why do you ask?

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:30.470
No reason! I don't know nothin'!

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.340
That kid...

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.300
Wasn't he with Rima this morning?

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.990
Kirishima-kun, what are you doing here?

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.540
You know him, Nagi?

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.920
Yeah. He's Kirishima Fuyuki-kun. 
We're in the same class.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.740
Do you need the Guardians for something?

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:01.770
I just... have a question for you, Fujisaki.

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:03.770
Could it be about Rima?

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.360
You gave Rima a love letter?!

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.100
Yeah.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.420
A billet-doux?

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.390
What happened next?

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:16.040
How'd she react?

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:19.430
It's been more than two weeks, but she hasn't responded.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.850
And she's been avoiding me...

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:24.480
I'm too nervous to ask her about it...

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.890
What if I asked for you?

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.430
Don't!

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:32.640
I sent the letter because I didn't have 
the courage to tell her face-to-face,

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:36.850
but I want another chance to tell 
her how I feel, in person this time.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:39.210
It's Mashiro-san's birthday today, right?

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:42.350
I had planned to give her a gift 
and then confess to her...

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:45.180
But at the crucial moment, I chickened out.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:50.750
Fujisaki! You're with her all the time for 
Guardian stuff. Do you have any advice?

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.810
I have no idea...

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:57.610
Kirishima-kun, do you really like Rima-tan?

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:58.400
Yeah.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:03.230
Now that you mention it, she had quite a number
 of fans when she first transferred here.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.470
Rima-tan!

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:10.220
Once everyone found out that Rima 
likes gags, they cooled off, though.

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:13.750
I didn't really like Mashiro-san back then.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.440
It was like... like she gave off this cold feeling.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:22.200
But at some point, she brightened up.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:33.950
Here.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:35.850
Thank you...

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:43.140
Amu!

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:44.020
Rima.

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:47.090
Let's go to the Royal Garden together!

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:47.840
Sure!

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:51.510
And I thought it was nice...

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.610
Sounds like you really do like her, all right.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.300
Okay then, we'll help!

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:59.380
Hinamori-san?

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:04.430
We'll just help give you a chance to 
talk to her. It's all on you after that.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:08.520
Sure! That'll be perfect!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:09.720
No prob.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:12.470
Will it end up being perfect, though?

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:15.680
All right!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:20.320
Let's start our first "Cheer on 
Kirishima-kun's Confession of Love" meeting!

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:21.850
Yay!

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:25.700
If you're really gonna go through with 
this, I want it to be the best confession ever!

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.190
Yaya...

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:31.860
To be honest, I've been going crazy 
trying to decide how to do it.

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.430
What's that?

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:38.520
Confession Pattern 1: Ask her to meet behind the school and confess.

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:41.350
Pattern 2: Confess over the phone?

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:45.890
Pattern 93: Appear on TV and confess.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:49.360
Pattern 94: Confess by carrier pigeon?!

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:51.790
Kirishima-kun's...

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:54.140
...pretty indecisive, it seems.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:56.770
Wait right there!

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:57.650
It's her...

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:03.560
I will never, never allow you to discuss 
matters of love without El, the Angel of Love!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.780
It's you!

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.190
Why are you here?

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:10.920
My romance radar showed a strong signal here!

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:12.780
So it was a radar array?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:17.200
And so, we will now formulate a plan 
to create the perfect love confession!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.060
Will this be okay?

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:20.930
Who knows...

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:22.670
What's the matter?

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:24.420
Uh...

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:26.570
Good luck, Kirishima-kun!

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:27.910
Thanks.

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:36.640
Friends! Friends! Friends are nice, you know?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:41.760
Ah, I thought someone was still here. 
Why haven't you gone home?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.850
I have Guardian work to do.

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:45.420
Work?

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:52.710
I don't really know much about that, but 
head straight home when you're done, okay?

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:55.570
No! Rima can't go home yet!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.870
<i>You</i> go home, Sensei!

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:00.720
Fine, fine, I get it...

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.930
You've really changed, Mashiro-san.

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:07.090
Anyway, good luck with your work.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.210
Nana, can't you sense anything?

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:28.170
Nothin'.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:30.330
Any a y'all children lost out there?

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:33.100
Any a y'all children lost out there?

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.720
Okay, next... the place!

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:38.510
It's gotta have a great view-

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:40.700
But I wanted a cake shop!

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:42.230
It's not <i>your</i> ideal confession, Yaya...

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.260
Well, I'm totally for a cake shop!

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:46.050
Girls sure like to talk about these things.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:47.140
My word...

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:49.620
What are you giving her for a present?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.890
I was thinking she might like a doll.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.660
A doll?

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.910
I believe something a bit 
more special would be nice.

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:58.510
Something special?

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:00.690
Like a comedian's autograph?

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:01.640
That's it-dechu!

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:06.080
Who is Rima-tan's favorite comedian these days?

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:10.810
Oh, it's got to be the Rakugo Master of Doki Doki Hall, Kyarasuke.

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:13.180
Note: Rakugo is an old form of Japanese comedic storytelling.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.180
What refined taste...

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:16.270
So how would we get his autograph?

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:20.410
Yes?

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:23.440
Amu? What do you want?

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:24.970
Um...

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:28.270
Get you an autograph?! Are you nuts?!

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.800
I knew she'd say that...

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:34.360
Oh, and if you see El around, tell her I'm angry!

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:37.350
I asked her to run some errands 
and she never came back!

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:38.180
Later.

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:40.710
Man, now she's mad at me!

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:42.640
Me, too...

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.270
So how about this?

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.970
Yaya-chan is really fired up today.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:54.640
She's happy that someone's going 
to tell Rima that they like her,

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.170
since we all love Rima ourselves.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.690
So that's why you want 
to help Kirishima-kun?

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:04.470
I think Rima's just running away from it.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:09.420
She gets along fine with us, but there's still 
a distance between her and others.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:15.650
I wonder if she's afraid to give 
Kirishima-kun an answer or face other kids.

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:21.160
Maybe that's okay, though... 
I used to think the same way.

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:25.370
But after I joined Guardians, I feel like I changed.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.220
And that's why I'm doing this for Rima now.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.350
The surprise party was your idea.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.560
I-I just thought it'd be fun, is all!

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.980
I think she'll understand.

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:43.450
Mashiro-san will understand your feelings, Hinamori-san.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:46.990
I hope so...

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.560
Okay, I've decided!

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:54.040
After giving it a lot of thought, I'm just 
going to come out and tell her how I feel!

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.720
Are you sure?

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:58.600
What about the cake shop or the awesome present?

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:02.210
Talking to you all has really encouraged me.

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.960
I can do it!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:04.850
Okay!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.300
But I have one favor to ask.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:15.220
If she accepts your confession, you 
better make her happy, all right?

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:18.210
But if she turns you down...

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:20.600
Please don't hate her, okay?

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.560
Sure!

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:25.600
Okay then, just wait here.

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:27.690
See you soon!

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:43.720
There you are, Rima-tan!

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.640
You're late!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:48.200
Rima, you're still here?

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:50.230
I thought you'd have gone home by now.

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.710
Hey, can we talk for a bit?

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:53.640
Okay...

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:59.830
I can feel it! I sense someone pretty dang lost!

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.870
Isn't this Hinamori Amu's school?

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:03.640
Well, yeah...

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:10.030
I'm getting kind of nervous.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:12.260
What should I say?

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.660
What if she says no?!

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.270
You're lost, aren't you?

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.190
Who are you?

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:23.690
Just do what y'all wanna do.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:25.790
Where are we going?

00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:27.640
You'll see when we get there.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:29.610
What is this feeling?

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.310
Sensing love in the air again?

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:34.010
No, it's the usual suspects-dechu!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.350
What? Now?

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:36.890
Hinamori-san!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.350
Amu-chan!

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.160
What is this?

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.500
Everything's covered in ribbons and hearts.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.350
Over there!

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.030
Why?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.190
Kirishima-kun...

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:56.590
You know him?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.390
Well, some stuff happened...

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.100
Mashiro-san.

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:01.390
Mashiro-san.

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.350
Mashiro-san!

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.770
Character Transformation: First Love Dream!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.250
Su!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.560
Right here!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.970
Let's go, guys!

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:23.770
My heart:

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:25.270
My heart:

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:26.450
My heart:

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:27.810
My heart:

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:29.350
Unlock!

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:45.780
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:49.880
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.770
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:58.620
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.180
Mashiro-san!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:08.180
I li... I li... I li...

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:13.890
He's still wavering, even after Character Transforming?

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:16.060
Well, this is new, ain't it?

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.640
It's heading toward the grounds!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:41.470
I like Hitomi-chan, from Star Class!

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:43.450
I like Saito-kun!

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:45.620
I like Uesugi-kun!

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:46.810
Maruyama-kun!

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.900
I wet the bed last night!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.360
I gained weight again!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.200
I forgot to wear underwear today!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:57.890
All of the things people want to 
admit, but can't, are bursting out!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.310
So he's making everyone else confess, instead of him?

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:02.600
That there's some attack...

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.640
Kirishima-kun...

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.520
Rima-chan!

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:19.570
I'm actually Nade-

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:20.690
Nade?

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:21.430
What?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.570
I'm in love with someone!

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:30.140
And that person's name is-

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:34.020
Tadase, come to your senses! This 
isn't the time for such things!

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:35.360
Amu!

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:37.020
Right.

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:41.280
Remake Honey!

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:58.060
Get a hold of yourself! Weren't you going 
to tell her your feelings straight out?

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:03.870
I think everyone's scared to tell 
others their true feelings.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.140
I know I am...

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:10.380
But if you keep avoiding it, 
nothing will ever happen!

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:13.250
You've just gotta do it, 
or you'll never know!

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:18.310
Don't be scared! Try to put 
your true feelings out there!

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:21.230
My true feelings?

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:28.810
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:34.820
Open Heart!

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.720
M-Mashiro-san!

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:31.300
Mashiro-san, happy birthday!

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:36.450
I like you! I know we haven't spoken 
much, but please go out with me!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.050
I know I should've replied...

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:50.400
Before I came to Seiyo Academy, 
I didn't have any friends.

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:54.830
I wasn't the type of person 
who expressed her feelings...

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:59.890
Back then, I would've thought it was a prank, and not replied for that reason.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:02.270
But...

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.770
I have people who are important to me now.

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:12.270
And for their sake, I don't want to be 
someone who lies to others anymore.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:17.270
I wasn't sure what to say, so that's 
why I haven't said anything yet.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:21.310
Thank you for confessing to me,

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:26.180
but I just can't imagine myself 
going out with someone.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:29.040
So... I'm sorry.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.980
Thank you.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:41.670
Thank you for honoring me
 by taking this seriously.

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:44.520
Here, you can still have this.

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:51.630
Okay, that's all, then.

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:53.400
Wait!

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.680
Amu, didn't you need me for something?

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:12.680
Ready, set...

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:15.380
Happy birthday!

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:17.850
Happy birthday, Rima-chan!

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:19.180
Happy birthday, Rima!

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.290
Rima-tan, happy birthday!

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:22.560
Happy birthday.

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:25.310
Thank you.

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:27.880
There you are!

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.440
Il!

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:31.870
<i>Why</i> are <i>you</i> here?

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:35.450
El, Utau said not to bother coming back.

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:38.720
Here, she told me to bring this.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.270
It's Master Kyarasuke's autograph!

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.450
Utau...

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:51.100
Hey, come on! Open 
Kirishima-kun's present already!

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:02.130
Thank you!

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:25.850
We'll walk this path,

00:22:25.850 --> 00:22:29.640
no matter what may happen.

00:22:29.970 --> 00:22:33.930
Because when we combine our strength,

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:37.850
something's bound to change!

00:22:45.720 --> 00:22:53.160
You're always so quick to say "absolutely,"

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:57.530
but shouldn't you think it through a bit first?

00:22:57.900 --> 00:23:00.910
Can't you at least do that???

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:05.660
You know, I'm starting to understand

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:09.120
the delicate movements of the heart.

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:16.580
My own abilities aren't really all that special...

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:21.880
But even if the first shot's off the mark

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:25.750
the third'll bravely hit the bull's-eye!

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:31.840
We'll walk this path,

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:35.460
even if it's a steep climb.

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:39.930
Because when we put our hearts together

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:43.880
something definitely changes!

00:23:49.730 --> 00:23:51.140
It's finally that time.

00:23:51.140 --> 00:23:51.900
Time for what?

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:53.980
Valentine's!

00:23:53.980 --> 00:23:55.030
O-Oh...

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:58.070
You're going to give 
Tadase-kun chocolate, right?

00:23:58.070 --> 00:23:59.150
Um...

00:23:59.150 --> 00:24:01.760
I recommend homemade chocolate.

00:24:01.760 --> 00:24:03.490
H-Homemade?

00:24:03.490 --> 00:24:05.340
Okay, let's try making some.

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:07.490
And then, I'll give it 
to Tadase-kun and...

00:24:07.490 --> 00:24:09.600
Go for it, Amu-chan!

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:11.560
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:11.560 --> 00:24:13.200
I Hate These Stupid Chocolates!?

00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:16.520
But I'm busy with all the Guardian stuff and...

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:18.360
Excuses, excuses, Amu-chan!
